# Pairwise — environment template.
#
# Key names only. Never put a real value in this file: it is committed.
# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in values there:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Deployed values live in Vercel environment variables, not in files.
# Vite exposes every VITE_* variable to the browser bundle, so never
# put a secret in a VITE_* key.
#
# The app reads no environment variables yet. Add keys here when the
# code starts using them (e.g. the backend API URL or DATABASE_URL).
